{%- comment -%}
  Renders a bundle (Build Your Box) cart line's contents — one row per flavour:
  a colour chip + flavour name + quantity. Owned by sections/bundle-builder.liquid.

  How it resolves the contents WITHOUT any extra data on the line item:
    - Flavours come from the box product's curated `custom.included_flavours`
      metafield (the same list the builder renders), so order matches the builder.
    - Per-flavour quantity is read straight from the VISIBLE line-item properties
      the builder writes (key = flavour name, value = "× N") via hash lookup —
      `item.properties[flavour.name.value]` — so there's nothing to parse.
    - The chip uses the flavour metaobject's `dark_colour` (the same field the
      builder tints its active cards with), falling back to a neutral chip.

  Renders nothing if the line isn't a bundle / the metafield is empty. The
  co-located stylesheet ships wherever the snippet renders — the cart drawer is
  global, so the styles must travel with the snippet rather than living in the
  bundle-builder section (which only loads on the bundle page).

  Expects:
    - item: cart line item object (the box product line)

  Usage:
    {% render 'bundle-line-contents', item: item %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign flavours = item.product.metafields.custom.included_flavours.value -%}
{%- if flavours != blank -%}
  <ul class="bundle-line unstyled-list">
    {%- for flavour in flavours -%}
      {%- assign qty = item.properties[flavour.name.value] -%}
      {%- if qty == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      <li class="bundle-line-row">
        <span
          class="bundle-line-chip"
          {%- if flavour.dark_colour != blank %} style="background-color: {{ flavour.dark_colour }};"{% endif -%}
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></span>
        <span class="bundle-line-name text-body">{{ flavour.name }}</span>
        <span class="bundle-line-qty text-body">{{ qty }}</span>
      </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .bundle-line {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-xxs);
  }

  .bundle-line-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  /* Colour chip — the flavour's brand colour. Default neutral fill + a hairline
     ring so pale or unset colours still read against the cart background. */
  .bundle-line-chip {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border);
  }

  .bundle-line-name {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .bundle-line-qty {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--color-text-accent);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
